# Recorded input for the table example (widgets/table.zig, `Example`), at 320 x 240 in the
# default theme: three 96 px columns from x 16 (Name, Kind, Size), the header row at y 41.5..71.5,
# five 30 px body rows below it. A resize handle is the 4 px at a header's right edge.
# Keys are USB HID usage ids: 79 Right, 81 Down.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 240
dt 0.016
pointer 300 225
# 1: hover the Kind header
frame
pointer 150 56
# 2: press it
frame
buttons left
# 3: release: sorted by Kind, ascending
frame
buttons
# 4: press it again
frame
buttons left
# 5: release: descending
frame
buttons
# 6: press the cell in row 2, column 0
frame
pointer 40 146.5
buttons left
# 7: release: it is active, the body focused
frame
buttons
# 8: Right
frame
press 79
# 9: Down
frame
press 81
# 10: press the Name column's resize handle
frame
pointer 110 56
buttons left
# 11: drag it to x 150: the column is 134 px wide
frame
pointer 150 56
# 12: release
frame
buttons
